  "description": "Author-created EN/RU input scenarios, not collected user messages. All variants of a physical token stay in one split. Candidate 5 folds the holdout-3 and holdout-4 families into development, carries the applications the shipped model abstained in and the `collisions` family (every pair of the shipped lexicons whose keys spell a lexicon word in both languages, resolved by the surrounding language), and adds transliterated loanwords and identifier-like terms as training negatives; holdout-5.json is the independent test.",
